Elixip / ElixiPG integration
----------------------------

This repository integrates with Elixip as an external execution runtime for the
ElixiPG proving ground. Elixip source code is not vendored into this repository;
CI and local tooling use an external checkout pinned by the integration.

Elixip is distributed by Emmanuel Buu / La Tribuu under the Business Source
License 1.1 (BSL 1.1), with license parameters and an Additional Use Grant
specified by the upstream project. At the integration pin used by ACE Omni:

- Licensor: Emmanuel Buu / La Tribuu.
- Licensed Work: Elixip and the tools identified by the upstream license.
- Change License: GNU General Public License version 3.0 or later
  (GPL-3.0-or-later).
- Change Date: two years after the publication date of each released version.
- The Additional Use Grant permits production use subject to explicit Elixip
  credit and contribution-back requirements for fixes and improvements made to
  the Licensed Work itself.
- The Additional Use Grant does not authorize a paid product or service that
  competes directly with Elixip in the reserved categories identified by the
  upstream license, including SBC, SIP proxy/B2BUA, and SIP/RTP/WebRTC testing
  products; those uses require separate commercial licensing.
- Elixip's upstream license expressly states that `.exs` scripts and scenarios
  executed by the Elixip scenario engine are not derivative works of Elixip and
  may be licensed independently by their authors.

ACE Omni's ElixiPG integration relies on that scenario boundary: the repository
contains ACE Omni-authored scenario/conformance code and points at an external
Elixip runtime rather than incorporating Elixip implementation source.

Required attribution for the external runtime:

  Elixip — SIP/RTP/WebRTC tooling by Emmanuel Buu / La Tribuu
  https://github.com/neutrino38/elixip

The complete Elixip license, not this summary, controls use of Elixip. The
integration is currently pinned to commit:

  fd0f7bf703dddfcefcf2cb28205776a5a402e192

Upstream license at that pin:

  https://github.com/neutrino38/elixip/blob/fd0f7bf703dddfcefcf2cb28205776a5a402e192/LICENSE.md
